UNWIND [{start: {_id:79}, end: {_id:82}, properties:{evidence:"The folding, maturation, and assembly of the gigantic S trimeric glycoprotein rely heavily on the protein chaperons inside the ER, such as calnexin. In fact, the N-terminal part of the S2 domain of SARS-CoV S protein has been found to interact with calnexin, and knock-down of calnexin decreases the infectivity of pseudotyped lentivirus carrying the SARS-CoV S protein (Fukushi et al., 2012).", pmid:"24987391", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"24987391"}}, {start: {_id:154}, end: {_id:155}, properties:{evidence:"Besides p38, DUSP1 has also been shown to dephosphorylate c-Jun N-terminal kinase (JNK) and ERK (Sun et al.,1993;Franklin and Kraft, 1997). It has been long proposed that ERK phosphorylation promotes cell survival, whereas prolonged JNK and p38 phosphorylation is linked to the induction of apoptosis (Xia et al., 1995).", pmid:"24987391", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"24987391"}}, {start: {_id:1489}, end: {_id:407}, properties:{evidence:"Therapeutic options include steroids, intravenous immunoglobulin, selective cytokine blockade (eg, anakinra or tocilizumab) and JAK inhibition.", citationType:"lancet", citationRef:"https://doi.org/10.1016/S0140-6736(20)30628-0"}}, {start: {_id:433}, end: {_id:386}, properties:{evidence:"Significantly high blood levels of cytokines and chemokines were noted in patients with COVID-19 infection that included IL1-β, IL1RA, IL7, IL8, IL9, IL10, basic FGF2, GCSF, GMCSF, IFNγ, IP10, MCP1, MIP1α, MIP1β, PDGFB, TNFα, and VEGFA. Some of the severe cases that were admitted to the intensive care unit showed high levels of pro- inflammatory cytokines including IL2, IL7, IL10, GCSF, IP10, MCP1, MIP1α, and TNFα that are reasoned to promote disease severity [6].", pmid:"32113704", annotationAnatomy:["blood plasma"], citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"32113704"}}, {start: {_id:436}, end: {_id:386}, properties:{evidence:"Significantly high blood levels of cytokines and che