pper airway congestion, sputum production,shortness of breath, myalgia/arthralgia, and gastrointestinal symptoms with lymphopenia, prolonged prothrombin time, elevated C-reactive protein, and elevated lactate dehydrogenase (LDH)", annotationSpecies:["9606"], pmid:"32164424", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"32164424"}}, {start: {_id:386}, end: {_id:427}, properties:{evidence:" Common symptoms included fever (88–98%), fatigue, dry cough, upper airway congestion, sputum production,shortness of breath, myalgia/arthralgia, and gastrointestinal symptoms with lymphopenia, prolonged prothrombin time, elevated C-reactive protein, and elevated lactate dehydrogenase (LDH)", annotationSpecies:["9606"], pmid:"32164424", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"32164424"}}, {start: {_id:386}, end: {_id:311}, properties:{evidence:"The estimated time from the first symptom to pneumonia (confirmed by radiology), hospital admission, acute respiratory distress syndrome (ARDS)and intensive care unit (ICU) admission were 5.0, 7.0, 8.0–9.0, and 9.5–10.5 days ", annotationSpecies:["9606"], pmid:"32164424", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"32164424"}}, {start: {_id:386}, end: {_id:236}, properties:{evidence:"The estimated time from the first symptom to pneumonia (confirmed by radiology), hospital admission, acute respiratory distress syndrome (ARDS)and intensive care unit (ICU) admission were 5.0, 7.0, 8.0–9.0, and 9.5–10.5 days ", annotationSpecies:["9606"], pmid:"32164424", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"32164424"}}, {start: {_id:386}, end: {_id:577}, properties:{evidence:"Major complications during hospitalization were ARDS, arrhythmia and shock.", annotationSpecies:["9606"], pmid:"32164424", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"32164424"}}, {start: {_id:386}, end: {_id:578}, properties:{evidence:"Major complications during hospitalization were ARDS, arrhythmia and shock.", annotationSpecies:["9606"], pmid:"32164424", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"32164424"}}, {start: {_id:386}, end: {_id:235}, properties:{evidence:"Factors associated with severe presentation included older, underlying comorbidities(hypertension, diabetes, coronary heart disease, chronic obstructive pulmonary disease) and presented with dyspnoea, anorexia, and rash", annotationSpecies:["9606"], pmid:"32164424", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"32164424"}}, {start: {_id:386}, end: {_id:581}, properties:{evidence:"Factors associated with severe presentation included older, underlying comorbidities(hypertension, diabetes, coronary heart disease, chronic obstructive pulmonary disease) and presented with dyspnoea, anorexia, and rash", annotationSpecies:["9606"], pmid:"32164424", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"32164424"}}, {start: {_id:582}, end: {_id:427}, properties:{evidence:"Higher lung injury Murray Score was associated with lymphopenia and higher levels of C-reactive protein, neutrophil percentage and LDH.", annotationSpecies:["9606"], pmid:"32164424", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"32164424"}}, {start: {_id:386}, end: {_id:583}, properties:{evidence:"Autopsy Histology Bilateral diffuse alveolar damage with cellular fibromyxoid exudates; pneumocyte desquamation and formation of hyaline membrane; interstitial lymphocyte-dominated mononuclear inflammatory infiltrates; multi-nucleated syncytial cells with atypically enlarged pneumocytes (large nuclei, amphophilic granular cytoplasm, prominent nucleoli) in intra-alveolar spaces", annotationSpecies:["9606"], pmid:"32164424", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"32164424"}}] AS row
