mptoms Severe respiratory disease.", pmid:"31967327", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"31967327"}}, {start: {_id:399}, end: {_id:391}, properties:{evidence:"Virus Bulbul coronavirus HKU11, Genus Delta, Host Bulbul, Symptoms Respiratory disease (collected from respiratory tract of dead wild birds).", pmid:"31967327", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"31967327"}}, {start: {_id:400}, end: {_id:391}, properties:{evidence:"Virus Sparrow coronavirus HKU17, Genus Delta, Host Sparrow, Symptoms Respiratory disease (collected from respiratory tract of dead wild birds).", pmid:"31967327", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"31967327"}}, {start: {_id:320}, end: {_id:386}, properties:{evidence:"The new decade of the 21st century (2020) started with the emergence of novel coronavirus known as SARS-CoV-2 that caused an epidemic of coronavirus disease(COVID-19) in Wuhan, China.", pmid:"32161092", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"32161092"}}, {start: {_id:300}, end: {_id:383}, properties:{evidence:"Coronaviruses have widely been known to cause respiratory and intestinal infections in humans after the outbreak of “severe acute respiratory syndrome (SARS)”in Guangdong, China", annotationSpecies:["9606"], pmid:"32161092", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"32161092"}}, {start: {_id:300}, end: {_id:511}, properties:{evidence:"Coronaviruses have widely been known to cause respiratory and intestinal infections in humans after the outbreak of “severe acute respiratory syndrome (SARS)”in Guangdong, China", annotationSpecies:["9606"], pmid:"32161092", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"32161092"}}, {start: {_id:300}, end: {_id:221}, properties:{evidence:"Coronaviruses have widely been known to cause respiratory and intestinal infections in humans after the outbreak of “severe acute respiratory syndrome (SARS)”in Guangdong, China", annotationSpecies:["9606"], pmid:"32161092", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"32161092"}}, {start: {_id:234}, end: {_id:227}, properties:{evidence:"SA