cytidylic acid) could augment the production of IFN-α, -β, and -γ, which consequently inhibited CoV replication and compensated for the inhibitory effects of CoV on IFN signaling pathways.", annotationCell:["naive T cell"], citationType:"preprints", citationRef:"10.20944/preprints202003.0206.v2"}}, {start: {_id:1487}, end: {_id:407}, properties:{evidence:"Therapeutic options include steroids, intravenous immunoglobulin, selective cytokine blockade (eg, anakinra or tocilizumab) and JAK inhibition.", citationType:"lancet", citationRef:"https://doi.org/10.1016/S0140-6736(20)30628-0"}}, {start: {_id:1488}, end: {_id:407}, properties:{evidence:"Therapeutic options include steroids, intravenous immunoglobulin, selective cytokine blockade (eg, anakinra or tocilizumab) and JAK inhibition.", citationType:"lancet", citationRef:"https://doi.org/10.1016/S0140-6736(20)30628-0"}}, {start: {_id:1477}, end: {_id:407}, properties:{evidence:"Therapeutic options include steroids, intravenous immunoglobulin, selective cytokine blockade (eg, anakinra or tocilizumab) and JAK inhibition.", citationType:"lancet", citationRef:"https://doi.org/10.1016/S0140-6736(20)30628-0"}}, {start: {_id:1479}, end: {_id:407}, properties:{evidence:"Therapeutic options include steroids, intravenous immunoglobulin, selective cytokine blockade (eg, anakinra or tocilizumab) and JAK inhibition.", citationType:"lancet", citationRef:"https://doi.org/10.1016/S0140-6736(20)30628-0"}}, {start: {_id:224}, end: {_id:386}, properties:{annotationCellstructure:["Endoplasmic Reticulum", "Golgi Apparatus"], evidence:"Remdesivir only and in combination with chloroquine or interferon beta significantly blocked the SARSCoV-2 replication and patients were declared as clinically recovered.", annotationDisease:["Severe acute respiratory syndrome coronavirus 2"], citationType:"Elsevier", citationRef:"10.1016/j.jare.2020.03.005"}}, {start: {_id:1508}, end: {_id:386}, properties:{annotationCellstructure:["Endoplasmic Reticulum", "Golgi Apparatus"], evidence:"Nafamostat, Nitazoxanide, Ribavirin, Penciclovir, Favipiravir, Ritonavir, AAK1, Baricitinib, and Arbidol exhibited moderate results when tested against infection in patients and in-vitro clinical isolates.", annotationBioassay:["in vivo", "in vitro"], citationType:"Elsevier", citationRef:"10.1016/j.jare.2020.03.005"}}, {start: {_id:558}, end: {_id:386}, properties:{annotationCellstructure:["Endoplasmic Reticulum", "Golgi Apparatus"], evidence:"Nafamostat, Nitazoxanide, Ribavirin, Penciclovir, Favipiravir, Ritonavir, AAK1, Baricitinib, and Arbidol exhibited moderate results when tested against infection in patients and in-vitro clinical isolates.", annotationBioassay:["in vivo", "in vitro"], citationType:"Elsevier", citationRef:"10.1016/j.jare.2020.03.005"}}, {start: {_id:333}, end: {_id:386}, properties:{annotationCellstructure:["Endoplasmic Reticulum", "Golgi Apparatus"], evidence:"Nafamostat, Nitazoxanide, Ribavirin, Penciclovir, Favipiravir, Ritonavir, AAK1, Baricitinib, and Arbidol exhibited moderate results when tested against infection in patients and in-vitro clinical isolates.", annotationBioassay:["in vivo", "in vitro"], citationType:"Elsevier", citationRef:"10.1016/j.jare.2020.03.005"}}, {start: {_id:1509}, end: {_id:386}, properties:{annotationCellstructure:["Endoplasmic Reticulum", "Golgi Apparatus"], evidence:"Nafamostat, Nitazoxanide, Ribavirin, Penciclovir, Favipiravir, Ritonavir, AAK1, Baricitinib, and Arbidol exhibited moderate results when tested against infection in patients and in-vitro clinical isolates.", annotationBioassay:["in vivo", "in vitro"], citationType:"Elsevier", citationRef:"10.1016/j.jare.2020.03.005"}}, {start: {_id:622}, end: {_id:386}, properties:{annotationCellstructure:["Endoplasmic Reticulum", "Golgi Apparatus"], evidence:"Nafamostat, Nitazoxanide, Ribavirin, Penciclovir, Favipiravir, Ritonavir, AAK1, Baricitinib, and Arbidol exhibited moderate results when tested against infection in patients and in-vitro clinical isolates.", annotationBioassay:["in vivo", "in vitro"], citationType:"Elsevier", citationRef:"10.1016/j.jare.2020.03.005"}}, {start: {_id:585}, end: {_id:386}, properties:{annotationCellstructure:["Endoplasmic Reticulum", "Golgi Apparatus"], evidence:"Nafamostat, Nitazoxanide, Ribavirin, Penciclovir, Favipiravir, Ritonavir, AAK1, Baricitinib, and Arbidol exhibited moderate results when tested against infection in patients and in-vitro clinical isolates.", annotationBioassay:["in vivo", "in vitro"], citationType:"Elsevier", citationRef:"10.1016/j.jare.2020.03.005"}}, {start: {_id:1511}, end: {_id:386}, properties:{annotationCellstructure:["Endoplasmic Reticulum", "Golgi Apparatus"], evidence:"Nafamostat, Nitazoxanide, Ribavirin, Penciclovir, Favipiravir, Ritonavir, AAK1, Baricitinib, and Arbidol exhibited moderate results when tested against infection in patients and in-vitro clinical isolates.", annotationBioassay:["in vivo", "in vitro"], citationType:"Elsevier", citationRef:"10.1016/j.jare.2020.03.005"}}, {start: {_id:621}, end: {_id:386}, properties:{annotationCellstructure:["Endoplasmic Reticulum", "Golgi Apparatus"], evidence:"Nafamostat, Nitazoxanide, Ribavirin, Penciclovir, Favipiravir, Ritonavir, AAK1, Baricitinib, and Arbidol exhibited moderate results when tested against infection in patients and in-vitro clinical isolates.", annotationBioassay:["in vivo", "in vitro"], citationType:"Elsevier", citationRef:"10.1016/j.jare.2020.03.005"}}] AS row
